chain: TS3006
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series TS3006a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: price | decision | Selling price (euro) | amount:number
object: max_cost | decision | Maximum production cost (euro) | amount:number
object: devices | decision | Devices the remote controls | outcome:enum[TV and video,TV only]
object: lcd | decision | LCD screen | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: speech | decision | Speech recognition | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: teletext | decision | Teletext feature | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: button_lights | decision | Lights under the buttons | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: energy | decision | Energy source | outcome:enum[kinetic,hand dynamo]
object: case_curve | decision | Case curvature | outcome:enum[single curved,double curved]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[rubber,plastic]
object: chip | decision | Chip | outcome:enum[simple chip,advanced chip]
object: buttons | decision | Buttons | outcome:enum[separate buttons,one scroll push-button]

